# Hygiene source deny patterns (regex, one per line).
# Goal: fail early on libc-like allocator naming leaks before boundary symbol scan.

# Function definitions only: disallow static malloc/free in kernel and userspace/libayken sources.
^[[:space:]]*static[[:space:]]+.*\bmalloc[[:space:]]*\(
^[[:space:]]*static[[:space:]]+.*\bfree[[:space:]]*\(
